OL,3,GNEWSA'County has just over 350 potholes
OL,4,Aleft to repair'
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors are working "rain or shine"
OL,7,Fto find and fix potholes in Suffolk,
OL,8,Fwith "just over 350" now remaining
OL,9,Facross the county, according to a
OL,10,Fhighways boss.
OL,12,FSuffolk County Council repaired 15,259
OL,13,Froad defects from January to the end of
OL,14,FSeptember - 20% more than the 12,736
OL,15,Ffixed during the same period last year.
OL,17,FThe authority is responsible for
OL,18,Fmaintaining 4,163 miles (6,700km) of
OL,19,Froads, 6,213 miles (10,000km) of
OL,20,Ffootways and 209 miles (337km) of
OL,21,Fcycleways in the county.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
