OL,3,GNEWSA'County has just over 350 potholes
OL,4,Aleft to repair'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Clements, assistant director for
OL,7,Fthe highways department, told the BBC
OL,8,Fhis "pothole repair gangs" had been
OL,9,Fworking hard to keep roads in good
OL,10,Fshape.
